lign="top" charoff="50">46&#x000b1;9<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8&#x000b1;5<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">130&#x000b1;10.7</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.0&#x000b1;1.0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20.5&#x000b1;4.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">K562/ADM</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">28&#x000b1;9.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8.2&#x000b1;3.0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">250&#x000b1;50<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20.2&#x000b1;8.1<sup>&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">21&#x000b1;6.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">K562/ADM with indomethacin</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">ND</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">ND</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">50&#x000b1;50<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x000b1;3<sup>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">ND</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">K562/ADM with 10&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> 5AZ</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">30&#x000b1;8.8</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.3&#x000b1;2.5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">100&#x000b1;20.8<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5.0&#x000b1;2.8<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20&#x000b1;5.0</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label/><p>ND=not done. IC<sub>50</sub> was calculated from cytotoxicity against various drugs. Data were average&#x000b1;s.d. from five independent experiments.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote2"><label>&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05, cytotoxicity in K562/P <italic>vs</italic> K562/MX2, or K562/ADM cells.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>&#x0002a;&#x0002a;</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05, cytotoxicity in K562 cells with <italic>vs</italic> without indomethacin treatment.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label>a</label><p>Cytotoxicity in K562 cells with <italic>vs</italic> without 5AZ treatment.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>